{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"line","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLStaffLinePosition","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL20MXLStaffLinePositionV","identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorMXL\/documentation\/IvorMXL\/MXLStaffLinePosition","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maps to a nested MusicXML "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"<line>"},{"type":"text","text":" element."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"metadata":{"title":"line","externalID":"s:7IvorMXL7MXLClefV7ContentV4lineAA20MXLStaffLinePositionVSgvp","symbolKind":"property","modules":[{"name":"IvorMXL"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"line","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MXLStaffLinePosition","preciseIdentifier":"s:7IvorMXL20MXLStaffLinePositionV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"?","kind":"text"}]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/ivormxl\/mxlclef\/content-swift.struct\/line"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Line numbers are counted from the bottom of the staff. They are only needed with the G, F, and C signs in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"order to position a pitch correctly on the staff. Standard values are 2 for the G sign (treble clef), 4 for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the F sign (bass clef), and 3 for the C sign (alto clef). Line values can be used to specify positions outside","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the staff, such as a C clef positioned in the middle of a grand staff.","type":"text"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/I